comp.os.ms-windows.misc	workgroup questions conven ram and licensing i would be very appreciative if someone would answer a few questions about windows for workgroups i currently have novell netware lite which does not work with windows very well and is a conventional memory hog ver i am considering moving all our machines to w wg q how much conventional ram does w wg use over and above the driver for the network card q if i have a novell ne card are the lsl and ipx drivers still needed q does w wg do a license check over the network to ensure each machine is running its own licenced copy of w wg note i do not want to break the license agreement and i will buy a copy of w wg for each of our machines it is just that i would like to try it out first to see if it meets our needs returning one opened copy is much easier than returning n opened copies q if you buy the upgrade to windows for w wg does it replace all of win as you install it or does it depend on current win files q if i install windows nt on my server when it comes out will i have any troubles with the w wg machines when i started this message i was going to ask only questions but i got carried away i ll stop now i look forward to your replies al alan walford eos systems inc vancouver b c canada tel aew eosvcr wimsey bc ca or uunet wimsey bc ca eosvcr aew
