pted i thought of that does anyone know if setting wm properties is by data copy or by reference pointer ie is it acceptable to pass data for a property then free the data xsetwmcolormapwindows dpy my topwin wlist nwlist xmapraised display win later on we handle xevents normally typical eventloop
