t but dodge stealth es auto does an wonder why you couldn t find it do you realize that a k sentra c d will run a that a sentra se r or saturn will run in the s don t you think it is kind of strange that your hp sports car is so easily beaten a mustang which weights about the same according to your numbers has less power and is much quicker care to explain don t be abusive just try and come up with a rational explanation of where those hp went to its a mystery to me the sentra se r really is alot quicker than the hp fwd sports car you are close to the k sentra e go look up the numbers in c d and report please no i m going to play your game no way sentra s are slow i took a test drive and it took to go why even the hyundai excel blows it doors i guess you drove a speed and couldn t shift craig
