e is i confess to deliberately evading copyright the file encoded with this keyphrase contains illegal scans of copyrighted peanuts strips judge and cp oh how will they get you now i m not saying that they won t or can t or even that they shouldn t but what legal mechanism will they use should we be crossposting this to misc legal peter trei ptrei mitre org
