nt algorithm and still not escrow their keys or they could just buy bunches of cheap phones at k mart every week and play swap the clipper chip with their cellular phone every day michael t palmer a man is crazy who writes a secret in any m t palmer larc nasa gov other way than one which will conceal it ripem key on server from the vulgar roger bacon
