atters and will continue unless overturned and the courts are reluctant to annul law or regulation going to some length to decide cases on other grounds furthermore congress can get away with quite a bit they could levy a burdensome tax this would place enforcement in the hands of the batf who as we ve seen you really don t want on your case they could invoke the commerce clause this seems most likely this clause will get you anywhere these days the th was required because the supreme court ruled a prohibitory statute unconstitutional in congress prohibited many drugs with a textual nod to the commerce clause the controlled substances act of still stands i think the government could get away with it amanda walker pgp key by finger or e mail eli ebrandt jarthur claremont edu
