er in a town of or so two pounds per person per week again sure sounds unrealistic to me thats just too meager to be healthy kiran now a two pound slab of ribs a day that s realistic fuzzy pink niven s law never waste calories potato chips candy whipped cream or hot fudge sundae consumption may involve you your dietician your wardrobe and other factors but fuzzy pink s law implies don t eat soggy potato chips or cheap candy or fake whipped cream or an inferior hot fudge sundae larry niven niven s laws n space
