ried in the back seat of a station wagon and giving yourselves anulments a half hour later i tend to agree with the response back there that said couples become married as soon as they consumate their marriage but i would add that couples should consider their marriage consumated if they have sex whether or not they intended to be married assuming they were both willing partners to the sexual act the couple must be prepared to raise any children they may have as a result of that sexual act with the benefit of both parents sex is a commitment i believe in god s eyes but i m digressing god be with you malcusco
