he order of at least k year your presumption of disadvantage i think is not borne out by the experiences of new york city s cops there the cops usually come out on top with their standard spl revolvers i ve seen s ws rugers and beretta mms in addition to the revolvers carried by chicago cops in the past i ve seen m s others have seen browning hi powers jason
