s herself with a gun the completion rate drops to g kleck point blank guns and violence in america aldine de gruyter ny jd wright ph rossi armed and considered dangerous a survey of felons and their firearms aldine de gruyter ny unlike cats dogs never scratch you when you wash them they just become very sad and try to figure out what they did wrong dave barry seth eliot dept of material science and engineering carnegie mellon univerity pittsburgh pa arpa eliot cmu edu or se andrew cmu edu bitnet se andrew cmccvb
