egislation for stricter harder to forge i d s plus national gun registration justified by a need to make the brady bill work this is the health card or so some paranoids claim i say that just because you re paranoid doesn t mean they re not out to get you please comment i m mainly interested in specific problems with the current legislation i don t mean to start a general discussion of the merits of any all waiting period bills ever proposed dillon pyron the opinions expressed are those of the ti dseg lewisville vax support sender unless otherwise stated when i m here when i m home texans vote no on robin hood we need pyron skndiv dseg ti com solutions not gestures padi dm
