at leadership changes e g to someone with ariel sharon s mentality then i would predict a considerable loss of life i e no winners secondly regarding your comment about the u s troops responding to stiff resistance the analogy is not quite valid the u s troops could get out of the neighborhood altogether the israelis could not just my worth no offense intended respectfully ben
