net for you chorus perhaps steven jobs should take paxton s advice and change his name to chrysler or perhaps set himself up as an s l maybe neil bush could give him a hand akasacou alfred ccs carleton ca no eternal reward will forgive us now for wasting the dawn j morrison the opinions expressed above are mine like anyone else would admit to them
