uld be considered harassment which it is not hate speech laws have generally been struck down by the courts i don t see how the words don t kill your baby or abortion is murder could be considered harassment anti abortionists have lost the battle for public opinion and the more psychopathic among them have turned to harassment arson bombing and murder to carry on their war there is no reason not to restrain them to protect the ordinary civil rights of everyone else some of the protesters were arrested for simply praying quietly on a public sidewalk yeah i could see how that might be equivalent to bombing and murder uh huh let us know when you get a grip on reality gordon fitch gcf panix com blg grn sta ny ny doug holtsinger
