ere white but that is an extremely difficult call to make it is possible the case but not definately i still think your actions are crap ted they are far more divisive than me using the adjective black in a non derogenory manner would you have been happier if i had used african american if so then you really are lost in the world of pc you have already been instrumental in getting one persons net access revoked and i wonder if you have sent a copy of my message to my sys admin with a plea that i am not worthy of posting the way you went about this polite inquiry makes me believe it was anything but
