s to me that belonging to the upper one third is not an unreasonable definition of upper middle class note that if that professor s spouse earns they become one of clinton s rich families here s a breakdown of national california and bay area household incomes k k k k us the census bureau did some weird ca rounding here more like ba and to add a little prespective a minimum wage earner working hours week makes year the poverty line for a family of four is if they make up to twice that the government considers them to be working poor say we decide to call this the lower middle class then how bout k annual income is middle class k is upper middle class k is rich k is filthy rich and is bill gates make sense timr there s nothing surer the rich get rich and the poor get poorer in the meantime in between time ain t we got fun raymond egan
